{"availability":"available","full":"rahul-iyer/duckdb-gql","name":"duckdb-gql","description":"An extension to run graph queries and algorithms using ISO GQL","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":54,"forks":3,"created":"2026-07-23T03:18:57Z","updated":"2026-10-04T15:03:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://duckgql.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:04.540Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:04.540Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:04.540Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:01:12.572Z","stars":54,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:15:04.540Z","stars":54,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["DuckGQL is an experimental C++17 extension that adds a growing subset of ISO/IEC 39075:2024 GQL to DuckDB. It combines graph pattern queries and mutations with DuckDB's native relational storage and execution engine, plus an explicit CSR layer for graph algorithms.","DuckGQL is under active development and is not yet a complete or conforming ISO GQL implementation. Use the conformance manifest, not parser coverage, as the source of truth for implemented language families."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rahul-iyer/duckdb-gql/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9d7e4bee7c9feecc4f43f78ff227cde8b643db6b3a4beff8ebf3443889197b33","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:01:12.844Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:01:12.844Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"DuckGQL is an experimental C++17 extension that adds a growing subset of ISO/IEC 39075:2024 GQL to DuckDB. It combines graph pattern queries and mutations with DuckDB's native relational storage and execution engine, plus an explicit CSR layer for graph algorithms.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rahul-iyer/duckdb-gql/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9d7e4bee7c9feecc4f43f78ff227cde8b643db6b3a4beff8ebf3443889197b33","sourceUrl":"https://g